===Etymology===
From {{der|en|la|Armenia}}, from {{der|en|grc|Ἀρμενία}} (early 5th century BC), from {{der|en|peo|𐎠𐎼𐎷𐎡𐎴|sc=Xpeo|ts=Armina}} (late 6th century BC); see it for more. The Old Persian name is an [[exonym]]: see {{m|xcl|հայ}} for the native name. Attested in English since late 14th century.

